  "prefLabel": "Puc 801.02 Application",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Puc 801.02 Application.\n\n(a) Each operator, as defined in Puc 802.12, shall:\n\n(1) Comply with Puc 800 and RSA 374:48-56; and\n\n(2) Maintain membership with the notification center.\n\n(b) Any person, including any person who owns or operates an underground facility in New Hampshire but who is not an operator, as defined in Puc 802.12, may become a member of the notification center.\n\n(c) Any member of the notification center who is not an operator but who owns or operates an underground facility shall comply with Puc 800.\n\nSource. #7350, eff 8-23-00; ss by #9226, INTERIM, eff 8-16-08; ss by #9318, eff 11-8-08; ss by #12102, eff 2-8-17",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/puc800.html"
